{"unit_id":"AvigatorC__dsh-conversation-width#card-zh","repo":"AvigatorC/dsh-conversation-width","commit":"71de3abb18ba8b88238b4bd4f20d06a55e5d1964","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-conversation-width 是一款面向 DSH Web 的界面插件，会在「设置 → 通用」加入对话框宽度设置行。用户可以保留默认拖动方式，或选择固定像素宽度、按对话列比例缩放；数值可直接输入，也能用箭头微调。固定模式会隐藏原有拖动手柄，并将宽度偏好保存在浏览器本地。适合希望让对话内容列保持稳定尺寸或随窗口比例变化的 DSH Web 用户；不需要 API 密钥或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:85-94","client.js:253-296","client.js:303-322"]}
{"unit_id":"AvigatorC__dsh-conversation-width#card-en","repo":"AvigatorC/dsh-conversation-width","commit":"71de3abb18ba8b88238b4bd4f20d06a55e5d1964","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-conversation-width adds a control to DSH Web General settings. Choose draggable, fixed pixels, or a percentage width. Enter a value or use arrows. Fixed modes hide the handle and save locally. It helps keep a steady or window-scaled conversation width.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:85-94","client.js:253-296","client.js:303-322"]}
